WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
Editing day.

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:04.530
Read every list in your writing out loud.

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:08.380
If you hear three things, you need two commas.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:12.960
A comma can change what a sentence means, so don’t guess.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:17.740
Ask how many things are in the list, then count your commas.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:21.920
One more slow read, and you’re ready to present.
